@startuml patron-composite
!include estilo.iuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide empty members
' Patrón Composite — certificaciones del piloto (sección "Documentación de la aplicación de Patrones de Diseño").
' Fuente de verdad: backend/app/models/concerns/certifiable.rb (interfaz común), backend/app/models/certification.rb,
' license.rb, qualification.rb y medical_certificate.rb (hojas) y backend/app/services/certifications/composite.rb
' (compuesto). Lo consume Preflight::DataCollector (to_summary). Coincide con iconix/where.json (Composite).
' Sin añadir, eliminar ni obtenerHijo: los hijos se arman en el constructor. Árbol de un solo nivel.

class "Preflight::DataCollector" as DataCollector <<Cliente>> {
  - certification_data()
}

class "Certifications::Composite" as Composite <<Compuesto>> {
  - components
  + valid_certification?()
  + expired?()
  + days_to_expiration()
  + expiration_date()
  + to_summary()
}

interface "Certifiable" as Certifiable <<Componente>> {
  + valid_certification?()
  + expired?()
  + days_to_expiration()
  + expiration_date()
}

class "Certification" as Certification <<base de las hojas>>

class "License" as License <<Hoja>>
class "Qualification" as Qualification <<Hoja>>
class "MedicalCertificate" as MedicalCertificate <<Hoja>>

DataCollector -right-> Composite : to_summary
Composite o-right-> Certification : components\n0..*
Composite -up..|> Certifiable
Certification -up..|> Certifiable
Certification <|-down- License
Certification <|-down- Qualification
Certification <|-down- MedicalCertificate

note bottom of Composite
  Sin añadir, eliminar ni obtenerHijo:
  los hijos se arman en el constructor
  a partir de las asociaciones del usuario.
end note
@enduml
